# [M5.0] D27 axis 5 -- \p refusals (extract Sec 3.1's 30-measured-error-147
# survey + the 4 block spellings). Authored as 34 blocks, ONE case each (a
# refusal has one case -- extract's own note); [UPROP-MORE] retired five (below), 29 now. These are PERMANENT refusals: once
# 'unicode-props' lands, PCRE2 itself still refuses every one of these bodies
# (error 147, "unknown property name") -- so today's `perr` (currently for the
# module-gate reason) IS this block's enduring correct shape; only the
# diagnostic WORDING changes, which D26 rules out of scope. Confirmed live,
# this cell's libpcre2 10.37 2021-05-26, against BOTH options=0 and PCRE2_UTF.
#
# [UPROP-MORE] (lane upropb, 2026-10-24) RETIRED FIVE BLOCKS, each for a stated
# reason. `Emoji_Modifier`, `Grapheme_Base` and `Grapheme_Extend` are binary
# properties libpcre2 10.46 ACCEPTS (the 10.37 survey above predates them) and
# pcrec ships them now: their witnesses are tests/utf8/uprop_more.rxt.
# `Block=Greek` and `blk=Greek` are pcrec EXTENSIONS beyond PCRE2 (D178): PCRE2
# still refuses them, pcrec accepts them under module unicode-props; their
# witnesses are tests/utf8/uprop_blk_age.rxt. `InGreek`/`IsGreek` stay refused.

# axis5 block p-refusal-A | pattern: \p{A} | PCRE2 error 147 (confirmed live, both options=0 and PCRE2_UTF) -- a PERMANENT refusal
pattern \p{A}
perr

